      "display_title": "Issue #2959: [Explore] Integrate API Based on Your Interest",
      "main_description_html": "<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5211537902\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/panorra-api-go/issues/518\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/panorra-api-go/issues/518/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/panorra-api-go/issues/518\">GoThruMedia/panorra-api-go#518</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Route</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-httpspec notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"GET /recommendations/posts/popular?window=&amp;page=&amp;limit=&amp;lat=&amp;lng=&amp;radius=\nAuthorization: &lt;JWT token&gt;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">GET</span><span class=\"pl-c1\"> /recommendations/posts/popular?window=&amp;page=&amp;limit=&amp;lat=&amp;lng=&amp;radius=</span><span class=\"pl-c1\"></span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-v\">Authorization:</span> &lt;JWT token&gt;</span></pre></div>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Endpoint</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">GET /recommendations/posts/popular</code></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Request</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-httpspec notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"GET /recommendations/posts/popular?window=7d&amp;page=1&amp;limit=12\nAuthorization: &lt;JWT token&gt;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">GET</span><span class=\"pl-c1\"> /recommendations/posts/popular?window=7d&amp;page=1&amp;limit=12</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-v\">Authorization:</span> &lt;JWT token&gt;</span></pre></div>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Response Fields</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  &quot;data&quot;: [ /* Models.ListPostsTimelineFeed rows — same shape as posts/most-popular-post-feed */ ],\n  &quot;total&quot;: 128,\n  &quot;page&quot;: 1,\n  &quot;limit&quot;: 12,\n  &quot;strategy&quot;: &quot;popular_personalized_7d&quot;,\n  &quot;debug&quot;: {\n    &quot;usedInterests&quot;: [&quot;nature_scenery&quot;],\n    &quot;usedIntent&quot;: &quot;explore_virtually&quot;,\n    &quot;fallbackReason&quot;: &quot;&quot;\n  }\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">{\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"data\"</span>: [ <span class=\"pl-ii\">/* Models.ListPostsTimelineFeed rows — same shape as posts/most-popular-post-feed */ </span>],\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"total\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">128</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"page\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">1</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"limit\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">12</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"strategy\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>popular_personalized_7d<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"debug\"</span>: {\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"usedInterests\"</span>: [<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>nature_scenery<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>],\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"usedIntent\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>explore_virtually<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"fallbackReason\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n  }\n}</pre></div>",
